          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78175,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usando le istruzioni <code>if</code> ed <code>else</code>, possiamo scrivere un programma che mostra un saluto se <code>hour</code> è minore di <code>12</code> e un altro se non soddisfa la condizione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>hour</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Questo programma saluta in un modo prima di mezzogiorno e in un altro negli altri casi.</p><p>Metti <code>hour</code> a sinistra. Crea la condizione per visualizzare <code>Good morning</code> quando è minore di <code>12</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"9\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good morning\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>hour</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;</code> e infine <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per una condizione più specifica, ad esempio se <code>hour</code> è maggiore di <code>12</code>, <strong>ma</strong> minore di <code>17</code>, possiamo invece scrivere <code>elif hour &lt; 17:</code>.</p><p><code>elif</code> è l'abbreviazione di else if. <code>elif</code> viene usato quando c'è una seconda condizione da verificare se la condizione del blocco <code>if</code> non è stata soddisfatta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>elif</code>, seguito da <code>hour &lt; 17</code> e infine <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>elif</code> significa <em>else if</em>: una seconda condizione verificata quando <code>if</code> è false.</p><p>Il controllo del mattino non è stato superato. Aggiungi il ramo che mostra <code>Good afternoon</code> quando <code>hour</code> è minore di <code>17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"hour &lt; 12\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>elif</code>, seguito da <code>hour &lt; 17</code> e infine <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Elif",
            "id": 78163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La <strong>istruzione elif</strong> esegue il proprio blocco di codice se le condizioni precedenti erano <code>False</code> e la sua condizione, come <code>hour &lt; 17</code>, è <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"62\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good afternoon\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>hour &lt; 17</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Else statement",
            "id": 78162,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo programmare un'istruzione <code>else</code> in modo che esegua il suo blocco di codice quando le condizioni <code>if</code> e <code>elif</code> sono <code>False</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"18\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good night\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "As many as we'd like",
            "id": 78174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finché vengono prima dell'istruzione <code>else</code>, possiamo aggiungere tutte le istruzioni <code>elif</code> che vogliamo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>elif</code>, seguito da <code>elif</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Puoi aggiungere tutti i rami <code>elif</code> che vuoi prima dell'istruzione <code>else</code> finale.</p><p>Completa i due rami centrali affinché la console mostri <code>Good evening</code> quando <code>hour</code> vale <code>20</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"hour = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good morning&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good afternoon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hour &lt; \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good evening&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Good night&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Good evening\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>elif</code>, seguito da <code>elif</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Adding elif",
            "id": 78161,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than ten&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Less than ten\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Less than ten</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Less than five</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Less than ten</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza <code>Less than ten</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than five&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" number &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Less than ten&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Less than ten\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>number &lt; 5</code> è <code>False</code>, poi <code>number &lt; 10</code> è <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe le condizioni sono <code>True</code>, ma il blocco <code>elif</code> sostituisce l'output di <code>if</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python salta la condizione <code>if</code> ogni volta che è seguita da <code>elif</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>number &lt; 5</code> è <code>False</code>, poi <code>number &lt; 10</code> è <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: elif keyword",
            "id": 78160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You got an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You passed\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>You passed</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>You got an A!</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>You passed</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza <code>You passed</code> invece di <code>You got an A!</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"score = \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You got an A!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"elif\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score &gt;= \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You passed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You passed\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>score &gt;= 90</code> è <code>False</code>, ma <code>score &gt;= 70</code> è <code>True</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Entrambe le condizioni sono <code>True</code>, quindi Python esegue solo il blocco <code>elif</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Il blocco <code>elif</code> viene eseguito prima che Python verifichi la condizione <code>if</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>score &gt;= 90</code> è <code>False</code>, ma <code>score &gt;= 70</code> è <code>True</code>.</p></body></html>"
